      <activity id="7680fd63-3b27-5f71-8b01-f17d4b36eff1" activityNameId="c44de7e9-773a-501c-b609-c5eed4d10e83" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Substation, offshore, 1005MW offshore wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Substation, offshore, 1005MW offshore wind farm
UUID=fc63d52d-40dc-3f28-9e70-93e50d571b2d
Offshore substation of a 1005 MW offshore wind farm. Included processes: manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on a fictitious offshore wind farm consisting of 67 wind turbines with a nominal capacity of 15 MW, as defined in the Renewable Energy Material Property Database, REMPD.

Main data source for material composition: 
Renewable Energy Material Property Database, REMPD (Cooperman et al., 2023)
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fc63d52d-40dc-3f28-9e70-93e50d571b2d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
